  "distinguishes": "Which dependency frames are well formed: one to max_dependencies_per_frame triples of a known scheme, 96 bytes each, no target, value or flags, an execution limit equal to 3000 per leanSPHINCS and 30000 per leanSTARK triple, and no state limit. A well-formed one passes to AG-6, which refuses it alone because nothing proves it.",
